    <h2 id="psf-schema">9. Database schema</h2>

    <p>Two tables ship with the module &mdash; one index, one grid-flat collection target.</p>

    <h3><code>panth_salefilter_product_index</code></h3>

    <table class="psf-table">
        <thead>
            <tr><th style="width:22%">Column</th><th style="width:18%">Type</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td><code>entity_id</code></td><td><code>int unsigned</code></td><td>Foreign key to <code>catalog_product_entity.entity_id</code>. Part of the PK.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>customer_group_id</code></td><td><code>smallint unsigned</code></td><td>0 = Not Logged In, 1 = General, 2 = Wholesale, 3 = Retailer, or any custom group id. Part of the PK.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>website_id</code></td><td><code>smallint unsigned</code></td><td>Website the flag applies to. Part of the PK.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>is_on_sale</code></td><td><code>tinyint(1)</code></td><td><code>1</code> = on-sale for this (product, group, website). Row is omitted when the answer is <code>0</code>, so the table is sparse.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>Primary key: <code>(entity_id, customer_group_id, website_id)</code>. Indexed on <code>(is_on_sale, website_id, customer_group_id)</code> for the sidebar count query.</p>

    <h3>Example rows</h3>

<pre><code>+------------+-------------------+------------+-------------+
| entity_id  | customer_group_id | website_id | is_on_sale  |
+------------+-------------------+------------+-------------+
|         14 |                 0 |          1 |           1 |  -- Push It Messenger Bag, Guest, Base, on-sale
|         14 |                 1 |          1 |           1 |  -- ...also on-sale for General
|         14 |                 2 |          1 |           1 |
|         14 |                 3 |          1 |           1 |
|         47 |                 1 |          1 |           1 |  -- MH01-XS-Black, General only (Members rule)
|         47 |                 2 |          1 |           1 |  -- ...Wholesale only
|         47 |                 3 |          1 |           1 |  -- ...Retailer only
|       2040 |                 0 |          1 |           1 |  -- Parent configurable via child special_price
+------------+-------------------+------------+-------------+</code></pre>

